### Create user
POST http://localhost:4000/user
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Jane Doe",
    "email": "jane@example.com",
    "password": "11111111"
}

### Create user with role in body — expect 400 (role is not on the DTO)
POST http://localhost:4000/user
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "aa",
    "email": "a@abc.com",
    "password": "111"
}

### Login — paste accessToken, refreshToken, and user.id into the requests below
POST http://localhost:4000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "a@abc.com",
    "password": "111"
}

### Me — should include "role": "USER"
GET http://localhost:4000/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer <accessToken>

### Refresh
POST http://localhost:4000/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "refreshToken": "<refreshToken>"
}

### Logout
POST http://localhost:4000/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer <accessToken>
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "refreshToken": "<refreshToken>"
}

